  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "先看最常见的一种，假招聘和假面试。",
   "spoken": "先看最常见的一种，假招聘和假面试。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.901
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "假招聘者在 LinkedIn 或 Telegram 上找到你，说有个高薪岗位，先做个测试。",
   "spoken": "假招聘者在 LinkedIn 或 Telegram 上找到你，说有个高薪岗位，先做个测试。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 5.34,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 5.436,
   "speechEnd": 11.881
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "然后发来一个 GitHub 项目，或者一个 Python 脚本。",
   "spoken": "然后发来一个 GitHub 项目，或者一个 Python 脚本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 12.28,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 12.378,
   "speechEnd": 15.915
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "关键在下一步，员工在工作电脑上，运行了外部代码。",
   "spoken": "关键在下一步，员工在工作电脑上，运行了外部代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 16.34,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 16.434,
   "speechEnd": 21.125
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "后门回连，偷走浏览器的会话 cookie、SSH 密钥和钱包。",
   "spoken": "后门回连，偷走浏览器的会话 cookie、SSH 密钥和钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 21.52,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 21.52,
   "speechEnd": 27.375
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "注意，偷的是会话 cookie，不是密码。",
   "spoken": "注意，偷的是会话 cookie，不是密码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 27.82,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 27.82,
   "speechEnd": 31.014
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "会话 cookie 是登录之后的凭证，拿到它，就能绕过多因素认证。",
   "spoken": "会话 cookie 是登录之后的凭证，拿到它，就能绕过多因素认证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 31.4,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 31.491,
   "speechEnd": 36.553
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "就算账号用了硬件密钥，通常也挡不住，硬件密钥只保护登录这一步。",
   "spoken": "就算账号用了硬件密钥，通常也挡不住，硬件密钥只保护登录这一步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 36.98,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 36.98,
   "speechEnd": 42.537
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "2024 年 3 月，钱包软件供应商 Ginco 的一名员工，就这样运行了一个测试脚本。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 3 月，钱包软件公应商 Ginco 的一名员工，就这样运行了一个测试脚本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 42.96,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 43.064,
   "speechEnd": 49.619
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "5 月，攻击者用偷来的会话，进入 Ginco 的系统，篡改了 DMM Bitcoin 的一笔交易。",
   "spoken": "5 月，攻击者用偷来的会话，进入 Ginco 的系统，篡改了 DMM Bitcoin 的一笔交易。",
